              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Total other operating and maintenance expenses per Dominion Energy Inc. Consolidated Statements of Comprehensive Income adjusted for asset impairment charges, the net loss or gain on the disposal of assets, and other unusual or nonrecurring items for the preceding year ended December 31st for the affected Dominion Companies. The following items are excluded from operating and maintenance expense: purchased gas expense, purchased power expense (including fuel expense), other purchased products and royalties, depreciation, depletion, and amortization, and taxes other than income. In addition, the following line items from the consolidated statements of comprehensive income are excluded, as they are reported separately from operating expenses: Other Income (Expense), Interest and Related Charges, and Income Tax Expense (Benefit).</span>
            </td>
